  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Trim green tops from Dutch carrots and scrub carrots clean.\n• Place carrots on a lined oven tray. Sprinkle with chermoula spice blend (see ingredients), drizzle with olive oil and toss to coat.\n• Roast until golden and tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• Once roasted, remove tray from the oven, drizzle over the honey and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cd864a0d670a6c9690a5a-7471e66b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a medium saucepan, add the water and bring to the boil.\n• Add couscous and stir to combine. Cover with a lid and remove from heat.\n• Set aside, until the water is absorbed, 5 minutes. Fluff up with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cd864a0d670a6c9690a5a-acd0716e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the couscous is cooking, thinly slice red radish.\n• Finely chop garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cd864a0d670a6c9690a5a-d814e67a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To a small microwave-safe bowl, add the garlic and a drizzle of olive oil. Microwave in 10 second bursts until fragrant.\n• Add Greek-style yoghurt and fetta cubes to garlic oil mixture and mash. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cd864a0d670a6c9690a5a-bcc69b6c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Just before serving, in a large bowl, combine couscous, radish, spinach & rocket mix, golden goddess dressing and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cd864a0d670a6c9690a5a-872f66bf.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide couscous salad between bowls.\n• Top with Dutch carrots and fetta yoghurt.\n• Garnish with flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cd864a0d670a6c9690a5a-79e7348b.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
